{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/14/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/15/desc","kr_sha":"9aab462a6b5f3a925d8a90c687f7dbc3ca38fe5598c3891d8abd2431aaa00339","zh":"- 如果說金枝給人的感覺是能將熾熱乃至溫暖的感情進行增幅和解放，那麼獨石感覺起來則是能迫使人面對其內心深淵中的沸騰之物，使其滿溢而出並最終爆發。\n- 和金枝不同，其或許是某種裝置，可以透過操作開啟或是關閉。操作方法像是走迷宮一樣，十分困難。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/15/id","kr_sha":"0489cafacac0727480b699b07f77b8d267132a0f47fa5dc5afe27425f5bebc26","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_107","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/15/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/16/desc","kr_sha":"3de6ab2eb81a0b4a468b55361b2a09cbcc0dc60f3abfc2f2fa4545e1d64f2a3e","zh":"- 橙色的軌道。上面寫著3號線。\n- 和之前猜想的一樣，每條軌道確實擁有不同的顏色。\n- 列車順著環形軌道通過沿途各個站點。和此前的軌道不同，因為中途能讓罪人們休息，因此不會太過困難。\n- 這次也遭遇了首次交戰的異想體。如浮士德所說，如果列車到達了異想體的世界，那麼這班列車也許能去往更遠的地方。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/16/id","kr_sha":"21b58ee38f65069fd85618c70be0e30c4d1bb8dfd674c8cf60f24767af81dc32","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_108","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/16/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/17/desc","kr_sha":"27ba85e8244d0c538836244afa8083648c19d6806d40bc33cd2f18aa38e22b01","zh":"- 在乘坐巴士經歷的旅途之中，隨著罪人們的不斷成長變強，罪種似乎也變強了。\n- 思來想去，出現的罪種種類增加果然應該是受到了金枝的影響。這與人格的成長是透過回收金枝進行同樣道理。\n- 因為之後也要繼續收集金枝……罪種的種類當然也會增加的吧。\n- 金枝、罪人……以及罪種。還有，我腦袋裡的金枝。我最終只能認為它們和我有某種聯繫。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/17/id","kr_sha":"06a40a46648b5d8a4c10d8993dd5f0bbfc76542357764b9fbb09e0784e2a46f8","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_109","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/17/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/18/desc","kr_sha":"0fd354d2a45f243af1f2bb72a5048df136fcf3e6536be0c6993c08cbe2ae7503","zh":"- 鏡像迷宮給人一種穿越抽象世界之感，折射軌道則有著更具體的形態。就如同走廊一樣。\n- 折射軌道的站點是誰建造的，失物招領處的報酬是誰準備的，那輛與梅菲斯托費勒斯有些相似的列車是從何處而來，而又是如何被放置的呢……我還不清楚的事情實在太多了。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/18/id","kr_sha":"086bb175b52abcf03ed4ebedc652ce9886b5102e17ae633a5098b0ed5ae3f42b","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_110","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/18/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/19/desc","kr_sha":"157d1664d788322e9b23c8f6ffaee12f9fecace6ab0860ec16ff9b692c6b44cc","zh":"- 都市中使人變強的方法形形色色。義體和強化手術之類的似乎就很流行。\n- 和擁有一具強大的身體一樣重要的是，在戰鬥之中如何作戰。\n- 收尾人事務所或協會……又或是幫派，都有各自使用的戰鬥方法，磨練那些方法的人們將會發展出劍法、武術、門派等等。\n- 根據希斯克利夫所說，僅僅接受了強化手術的身體往往會成為沙包。良秀則說，接受了什麼樣的手術，以及訓練了什麼樣的武器和什麼樣流派的武藝都很重要。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/19/id","kr_sha":"a819a67f0d6322835535ec1fe072e493fc9e0df84f2e76d8a79ecc752db39759","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_111","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/19/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/20/desc","kr_sha":"adfda9ceb8a61f7e6563644d20ff8c0ec551bc488fb71ff5c0a4bdfa2af762c8","zh":"- 我無意中聽戰鬥經驗豐富的人格說過，想要在都市中變強，單靠投資重金的身體是不行的。\n- 雖然可以製造出結實且輸出功率強大的身體，但如何在戰鬥中使用那具身體卻是需要經驗和努力的領域。\n- 但羅佳說，歸根究底，做什麼都需要花很多錢才是真理。有錢不一定能變強，但沒有錢是萬萬不能變強的。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/20/id","kr_sha":"62cd8a8c542cbf62a1d353e798fb8259feb229b1dc4e72bbdca2d6fdda0d7248","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_112","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/20/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/21/desc","kr_sha":"719f1d75a9b4e851ee60e35ba8b80e2339e01b4e2faa08c4421444fb2941e6a2","zh":"- 郊區有人類居住的村莊。這並非是因為預定的探索，而是多虧了希斯克利夫和唐吉訶德，我才知道……\n- 好像是在哪裡聽到過，郊區有著和異想體以及扭曲都不同的怪物，似乎想要殺害人類。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/21/id","kr_sha":"8da76ba841e6282d56b4eecaa435b31635d6708effab61d5aa9acacff0cd42d8","zh":"DanteNoteDetail_113","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/21/title","kr_sha":"e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855","zh":"","origin":"copy","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
{"key":"StoryTheaterDanteNoteDetail_6.json|/dataList/22/desc","kr_sha":"a6a099c4f7bb941215286b0e4e1aa1348754cf0ca419931a4ee3a695de598085","zh":"- 小矮人和巨人……我們遇到了並非人類的知性體。它們與異想體明顯不同。\n- 因為我們只去過郊區的某個工廠，所以還難以想像大湖以外的郊區區域內的情況。但是從工廠的樣子來看，也許不僅僅只有我們常識以外的存在。\n- 辛克萊說，就像德米安所說的那樣，這裡可能真的很適合居住，以實瑪利則反駁道，即使這裡是適合居住的好地方，只要有對人類懷有巨大敵意的存在，就不能一概而論地將其稱之為宜居之處。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"563a0bf5b2d7ab2426f09b1eb3566a5beec92bf0"}
